The column of the quote that owns a first-block plus stays eligible at every depth

```
- - > +
    b
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <blockquote><p>b</p></blockquote>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- - - > +
      b
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <blockquote><p>b</p></blockquote>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- > > +
    b
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <blockquote>
      <blockquote><p>b</p></blockquote>
    </blockquote>
  </li>
</ul>
```
